  title: Frozen Bamboo
  description: "Oh no! The cold weather has stopped the bamboo from growing! \nAlmost
    all the food is gone. If it stays much longer, it might starve! There may be
    more food further down the mountain. \nShould the panda move somewhere else or
    stay on the mountain? "
  choiceA: Move
  choiceB: Stay
  choiceC: 
  titleDA: Frossen
  descriptionDA: "\xC5h nej! Kulden har f\xE5et bambussen til at stoppe med at vokse!
    \nN\xE6sten alt mad er v\xE6k. Hvis pandaen bliver meget l\xE6ngere, kan den
    sulte ihjel! M\xE5ske er der mere mad l\xE6ngere nede ad bjerget. \nSkal pandaen
    flytte et andet sted hen eller blive p\xE5 bjerget? "
  choiceADA: Flyt
  choiceBDA: Bliv
